  "instructions": [
    "Cook the noodles according to the package directions.",
    "Melt the butter and olive oil together in a saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the onions, garlic, and red pepper flakes. Cook until the onion is translucent, about 7 to 10 minutes.",
    "Add the vodka and allow the alcohol to cook out, about 15 minutes.",
    "Add the tomato sauce, salt, and pepper. Bring to a simmer for an additional 5 minutes.",
    "Add the heavy cream and stir to combine. Don't allow the sauce to become too hot or the cream could break or curdle.",
    "Bring the sauce to a simmer again and remove from heat.",
    "Combine the sauce with the noodles and toss to coat.",
    "Top with grated parmesan and serve immediately."
